OF:
$$\min \left\{ \sum_{i=1}^{n} t_i : (r, c) = (t_i)_{i=1}^{n}, \, i \in I \right\} $$
where:
- \( t_i \) is the time of transition \(i\) in the path;
- \( n \) is the total number of transitions on the optimal path;
- \( I \) is the index set for all possible paths.

\[
\min \sum_{i=1}^{n} c_i(s_{ij}) \quad \text{where } s_{ij} \text{ is the service chosen between regions } r_i \text{ and } r_j, \text{ and } c_i(s_{ij}) \text{ represents its cost.}
\]
